      "text": "-> Create a file named `Dockerfile` in the root of the project.\n-> This Dockerfile is a config files which tells how to create this image.",
      "rawText": "-> Create a file named `Dockerfile` in the root of the project.\n-> This Dockerfile is a config files which tells how to create this image.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> Create a file named `Dockerfile` in the root of the project.\n-> This Dockerfile is a config files which tells how to create this image.",
