      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 8080 → Host machine port.\n- 3000 → Container port.\nNow, accessing localhost:8080 on your host machine\nforwards the request to port 3000 inside the container.",
      "rawText": "- 8080 → Host machine port.\n- 3000 → Container port.\nNow, accessing localhost:8080 on your host machine forwards the request to port 3000 inside the container.",
