      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> The --rm flag automatically removes a container after it stops executing, preventing stopped\ncontainers from accumulating on your system.",
      "rawText": "-> The --rm flag automatically removes a container after it stops executing, preventing stopped containers from accumulating on your system.",
      "fontSize": 20,
